  "status": "present",
  "value": "text is printable ASCII made of literal characters other than \"{\" and \"}\", variable placeholders \"{name}\" and plural blocks \"{name, plural, one{A} other{B}}\" written with exactly that spacing, where name matches [A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]* and A and B contain no braces. keys and values are equal-length lists, keys distinct, values printable ASCII without braces. A placeholder becomes the value of its key. A plural block becomes A when the value is exactly \"1\" and B otherwise, with every \"#\" in the chosen branch replaced by the value; values used by plural blocks are decimal integers. An expression whose name is not in keys is left unchanged. Inserted values are not scanned again.",
